* BSZ520N15NS3 (Infineon, 150 V / 52 mOhm) - VDMOS model from LTspice standard.mos
* Wrapped as a 3-pin subcircuit so it is pin-compatible with the Infineon
* BSZ520N15NS3_L0 / _L1 subcircuits:  XM2 drain gate source BSZ520N15NS3_VD
* LTspice info-only parameters (mfg=Infineon Vds=150 Ron=52m Qg=9n) removed.
* Much cheaper to evaluate than Infineon's L1 model; no thermal or package-L effects.
.subckt BSZ520N15NS3_VD drain gate source
M1 drain gate source BSZ520N15NS3_VDM
.model BSZ520N15NS3_VDM VDMOS(Rg=2.1 Vto=4.4 Rd=32.58m Rs=514u Rb=3.82m Kp=18.3
+ Lambda=0.02 Cgdmin=2p Cgdmax=0.1n A=0.5 Cgs=0.66n Cjo=1n M=0.4 Is=25.2p VJ=0.9
+ N=1.185 TT=100n ksubthres=.1)
.ends BSZ520N15NS3_VD
